UID:transrockies-run-pass-to-pub-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260622T000000Z
DTSTART:20260719T080000Z
DTEND:20260719T120000Z
SUMMARY:TransRockies Run - Pass to Pub
DESCRIPTION:A multi-day trail running adventure in the Colorado Rockies. Described as 'the adventure of a lifetime' with a strong community focus. The event spans 3 days (July 19th-21st\, 2026) and offers two distance options.
