UID:pikes-peak-ultra-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260622T000000Z
DTSTART:20260725T050000Z
DTEND:20260725T090000Z
SUMMARY:Pikes Peak Ultra
DESCRIPTION:Part of the Mad Moose Herd\, this technical trail race utilizes the Ring the Peak trail system. While it doesn't summit the mountain\, it offers relentless climbing and stunning vistas of Pikes Peak and the surrounding Front Range.
LOCATION:Bear Creek Regional Park\, 2150 W 21st St\, Colorado Springs\, CO 80904
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
