UID:staunton-trail-race-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260622T000000Z
DTSTART:20260725T070000Z
DTEND:20260725T110000Z
SUMMARY:Staunton Trail Race
DESCRIPTION:Come run with us in amazing Staunton State Park! This race day will offer a 5k race & a 10 mile race. Registration Check-in starts at 6am at the Ranch Hand parking lot just past the Visitor's Center at Staunton State Park. Day of registration price increases by $5. Races will start promptly at 7am.
LOCATION:Staunton State Park\, Ranch Hand parking lot\, Evergreen\, CO 80439
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
