DTEND:20260807T120000Z
SUMMARY:Choice City Running Festival
DESCRIPTION:A two-day running festival featuring the 28th Annual Jane Welzel Mountain Avenue Mile on August 7th and the 43rd Annual Human Race including a Half Marathon\, 10K\, and 5K on August 8th. Registration opens May 31st.
