DTEND:20260815T120000Z
SUMMARY:Mt. Sneffels Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Mt. Sneffels Half Marathon\, 10K\, and Kids Fun Run held in Ouray\, Colorado\, the 'Switzerland of America'. Benefits the Mount Sneffels Education Foundation\, which has funded over $1.5 million into educational programs for Ouray County children since 1992. Early registration discount and shirt guarantee available for entries before July 1st.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
