SUMMARY:Mount Sneffels Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Run in the 'Switzerland of America'. The Mt. Sneffels Half Marathon\, 10K\, and Kids Fun Run benefits the Mount Sneffels Education Foundation\, which has funded over $1.5 million into over 865 programs enriching the lives of Ouray County children since 1992. Register before July 1st for race registration discount and shirt guarantee.
