SUMMARY:Mudgirl Denver
DESCRIPTION:Mudgirl is an obstacle race dedicated to women. The Denver event takes place on August 29th & 30th\, 2026 at Colorado National Speedway. Participants receive a headband\, wristband\, bag\, finisher medal\, and tattoo. The race includes a festival\, rinsing stations\, and changing rooms for participants.
LOCATION:Colorado National Speedway\, 4281 County Road 10\, Dacono\, CO 80514\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
