DTSTAMP:20260622T000000Z
DTSTART:20260905T060000Z
DTEND:20260905T100000Z
SUMMARY:Grand Traverse Mountain Run
DESCRIPTION:The Grand Traverse Mountain Run is a point-to-point ultramarathon from Crested Butte to Aspen\, Colorado. The course follows the route of the Grand Traverse Backcountry Ski race. Runners travel 40 miles across the Elk Mountains with over 6\,000 feet of elevation gain. The event is operated as a fundraising event for Crested Butte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) recreational non-profit organization.
LOCATION:Town Park\, Crested Butte\, CO to Ajax Park – 1001 S. Ute Ave\, Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
