UID:the-grand-traverse-bike-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260622T000000Z
DTSTART:20260906T080000Z
DTEND:20260906T120000Z
SUMMARY:The Grand Traverse (Bike)
DESCRIPTION:The Grand Traverse Bike is a 40-mile point-to-point mountain bike race from Crested Butte to Aspen\, CO. Part of the Grand Traverse Triple Crown series (Ski\, Run\, Bike)\, the race is operated as a fundraising event for Crested Butte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) non-profit. The route is partially based on historic mail routes connecting the Colorado mining towns of Crested Butte and Aspen from the 1880s. General registration opens at midnight on December 1st.
LOCATION:Crested Butte\, CO to Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
