DTSTAMP:20260622T000000Z
DTSTART:20260919T080000Z
DTEND:20260919T120000Z
SUMMARY:Pikes Peak Ascent & Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The oldest continually held marathon in the United States (founded in 1956). Runners start from Manitou Springs and travel to the summit of Pikes Peak at 14\,115 feet and back down. Both the Marathon and Ascent climb approximately 7\,800 vertical feet up the historic Barr Trail on the east face of the mountain.
LOCATION:441 Manitou Ave\, Suite 100\, Manitou Springs\, CO 80829
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
