SUMMARY:Cougar Ridge Classic 26K Trail Run
DESCRIPTION:Point-to-point trail running race starting in Vail and finishing in the Town of Minturn. The 26K course covers 16.1 miles with 3\,439' elevation gain\, traversing Vail Mountain with views of Mount of the Holy Cross and golden aspen groves. The new Cougar Cub 14K option starts at Eagle's Nest and covers 8.9 miles with 591' elevation gain. Registration limited to 250 racers. Includes post-race party and awards in Minturn with lunch vouchers at participating restaurants.
LOCATION:352 E Meadow Dr.\, Vail\, CO (Start - Gravity Haus\, Vail)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
