SUMMARY:West Line Winder
DESCRIPTION:The West Line Winder 30K & 50K features miles of buttery single track and forest roads with glorious views of the Collegiate Peaks\, set on arid desert-style trails just outside of Buena Vista\, CO. Suitable for first-time trail runners to veteran ultramarathoners. Hosted by 14er Fest\, the event includes trail events\, clinics\, festival camping\, live music\, local libations\, and vendors.
