SUMMARY:Durango Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The inaugural Durango Marathon Weekend features a scenic road race experience through one of Colorado's most beautiful mountain communities. Starting and finishing at Santa Rita Park along the banks of the Animas River\, runners will enjoy crisp autumn temperatures\, spectacular fall colors\, and sweeping views of the San Juan Mountains. The marathon and half marathon courses climb through eastern Durango past Fort Lewis College before returning to town on the scenic Animas River Trail. All races start and finish at Santa Rita Park with aid stations every 3-5 miles. Race proceeds support the Durango Education Foundation scholarships.
LOCATION:111 South Camino Del Rio\, Durango\, CO 81301
